From 5c2ec3ca6a34131890d5f068140cc40f169040a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 19:37:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): redesign Standard Mode as a government
 investigative portal skin

Visual layer only (no backend, API, data or business-logic changes; Analysis Mode untouched).
- New rem-based, flat, high-contrast design system (standard-mode.css); no glow/glass/animation
- Government header: 'Government of [X]' bar, emblem + department placeholders (config/standardPortal.js), nav bar, case search
- Table-first pages: dashboard, correlation (case details, entity/connection registers, skinned graph), reports, login
- Formal modals, footer with disclaimer, breadcrumbs, skip link, print + high-contrast support
- Standard-only page variants routed via ModeSwitch; existing Analysis pages unchanged
